Class name - Desk
    EXPLAIN: I added "private Size size", "private boolean isWood", and "private String color" because those were the things I could think of to
    describe a desk. After that, I added the constructor, setters, and getters. And, then the toString method with an if-else statement for the
    boolean variable, followed by the return statement [return String.format("Size of Desk: %s\nIs it made of wood?: %s\nColor: %s\n",size, isWood, color)].

