Class name - WallSize
    EXPLAIN: I made this class because to get the area of a wall for the Wall class, I need height and width, rather than width and length because
    technically, when talking about a wall, width and length can be represented by the same number. In that case, this class is almost identical to
    the Size class, with the exception of height becoming length.

